<feed xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><title>BBC Chinese</title><subtitle type="html">BBC Chinese - BBC News , 中文 - 主頁</subtitle><id>https://feeds.bbci.co.uk/zhongwen/trad/rss.xml</id><updated>2026-10-09T21:02:49Z</updated><author><name>rssync</name></author><link rel="self" href="rss.xml" type="application/atom+xml" /><link rel="alternate" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/trad" /><link rel="via" href="https://feeds.bbci.co.uk/zhongwen/trad/rss.xml" type="application/rss+xml" /><entry><title>特朗普與普京達成協議允俄國出售柴油，澤連斯基批評「送大禮」</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwg7xz103032o/trad#0</id><updated>2026-10-09T21:02:49Z</updated><published>2026-10-09T20:33:46Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwg7xz103032o/trad--a58287d83b49.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwg7xz103032o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">烏克蘭總統表示，容許俄羅斯出售石油產品，只會延長這場本應結束的戰爭。</summary></entry><entry><title>美國要網上直播軍法槍決胡德堡基地槍擊案兇手</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cqr7yvg2n4kvo/trad#0</id><updated>2026-10-09T21:01:49Z</updated><published>2026-10-09T04:39:43Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cqr7yvg2n4kvo/trad--7ccfa6d9b002.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cqr7yvg2n4kvo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">美國國防部長赫格塞斯表示，這場處決將公開進行，但一名法律專家指出，這項「前所未有」的決定處於「法律基礎不明確的領域」。</summary></entry><entry><title>老撾的班根軍用機場 中國能用來做甚麼？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmwy48r8ex41o/trad#0</id><updated>2026-10-09T21:01:49Z</updated><published>2026-10-09T00:18:18Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmwy48r8ex41o/trad--6a5ba222296a.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmwy48r8ex41o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">專家認為，未來的班根軍事設施可能承擔更多功能，而不僅僅是一個普通的訓練中心。</summary></entry><entry><title>台灣AV盛極而衰：中國市場如何催生這場成人片熱潮？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cqlymyyze8mjo/trad#0</id><updated>2026-10-09T21:01:49Z</updated><published>2026-10-08T09:37:08Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cqlymyyze8mjo/trad--38da8fdcbc19.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cqlymyyze8mjo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">台灣曾被視為亞洲唯一能合法拍攝無碼成人影片的地區，並在2020年前後快速擴張。隨著片商「麻豆傳媒」停運，外界開始質疑這波繁榮是否與中國市場及博弈資金有關。</summary></entry><entry><title>法國學生示威：憤怒背後隱藏著什麼？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/crz98g94n9k5o/trad#0</id><updated>2026-10-09T21:01:49Z</updated><published>2026-10-09T09:42:25Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/crz98g94n9k5o/trad--a741d1a83154.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/crz98g94n9k5o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">法國中學生示威來自對制度的不滿，但也源自於法國在街頭與制定政策的傳統。</summary></entry><entry><title>俄羅斯鼠疫會引發一場全球疫情嗎？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ckwyq35pnxjno/trad#1</id><updated>2026-10-09T21:01:49Z</updated><published>2026-10-08T12:34:52Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ckwyq35pnxjno/trad--8286e8e3f4d5.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ckwyq35pnxjno/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">與新冠病毒不同，肺鼠疫要等到症狀出現後才能傳播，通常在24小時內。症狀嚴重且明顯，因此後續個案可在傳播發生前被迅速辨識、隔離並治療。</summary></entry><entry><title>「那揮之不去的恐懼」：「宿醉焦慮」真的存在嗎？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6d09ed707jxo/trad#1</id><updated>2026-10-09T21:01:49Z</updated><published>2026-10-09T00:18:12Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6d09ed707jxo/trad--4a844aab70e7.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6d09ed707jxo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">「宿醉焦慮」（hang-xiety），大約十年前在社交俚語中被創造出來的名字，用來形容可能伴隨宿醉而來的焦慮感。目前它的存在被研究證實。</summary></entry><entry><title>扎克伯格有形象問題，為何Meta的業務卻蒸蒸日上？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cvj6jz6e89n2o/trad#1</id><updated>2026-10-09T21:01:49Z</updated><published>2026-10-09T08:04:54Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cvj6jz6e89n2o/trad--50eed29a70b4.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cvj6jz6e89n2o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">一部新電影將扎克伯格的描繪成一個反派角色。但這家科技公司的收益及產品似乎不受負面形象的影響。</summary></entry><entry><title>口譯與施壓：台灣楊双子德國活動捲入政治爭議的前前後後</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmd7q5glg9llo/trad#1</id><updated>2026-10-09T21:01:49Z</updated><published>2026-10-08T05:29:23Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmd7q5glg9llo/trad--551979dce7b0.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmd7q5glg9llo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">楊双子在慕尼克的座談會遇上翻譯連番失誤，且傳出中國領館曾要求取消活動之說，但德國主辦方對BBC中文予以否認。</summary></entry><entry><title>到底是鼠疫嗎？俄羅斯實驗室人員死因說法不斷變化</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c8wy910lv7q6o/trad#1</id><updated>2026-10-09T21:01:49Z</updated><published>2026-10-07T10:24:31Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c8wy910lv7q6o/trad--209d6d742b5b.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c8wy910lv7q6o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">俄羅斯一名實驗室技術員在西伯利亞一家鼠疫研究中心死亡，引發了人們對實驗室可能發生病毒洩漏的疑慮。</summary></entry><entry><title>美國中期選舉是甚麼？這是一份簡易指南</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cq5ynx00d4leo/trad#1</id><updated>2026-10-09T21:01:49Z</updated><published>2026-10-08T04:41:43Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cq5ynx00d4leo/trad--30e500462b02.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cq5ynx00d4leo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">美國選民將於11月3日前往投票，這場選舉的結果可能對唐納德·特朗普（川普）的總統任期產生重大影響。</summary></entry><entry><title>加州一對華裔夫婦被控虐待至少14名代孕子女</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cr4g1w328qxqo/trad#1</id><updated>2026-10-09T21:01:49Z</updated><published>2026-10-08T05:27:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cr4g1w328qxqo/trad--7f4c8da5da98.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cr4g1w328qxqo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">經營代理孕母服務的兩夫妻在加州豪宅中被捕，此前有21名兒童被從他們的監護下帶走。兩人目前拒絕認罪。</summary></entry><entry><title>以色列大選：哈馬斯襲擊三年後，以色列民眾要求追究責任</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c615j9n1xlkpo/trad#1</id><updated>2026-10-09T21:01:49Z</updated><published>2026-10-08T07:50:44Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c615j9n1xlkpo/trad--a6a386400cca.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c615j9n1xlkpo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">三年過去，以色列總理內塔尼亞胡拒絕為以色列的安保失敗承擔任何個人責任，也拒絕下令進行國家調查。</summary></entry><entry><title>機師刀刺同僚企圖劫機 杜拜往以色列航班乘客化解空難</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ck3rerpdp7x9o/trad#2</id><updated>2026-10-09T21:01:49Z</updated><published>2026-10-01T06:20:54Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ck3rerpdp7x9o/trad--749b0d4eb1b4.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ck3rerpdp7x9o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">一架從阿聯酋杜拜飛往以色列的「杜拜航空」（Flydubai）客機上，發生企圖空中劫機事件。其中一名機師刺傷另一名機副機後，機上乘客在機人員協助下闖進駕駛艙並合力制伏施襲者。以色列即將舉行大選，當局尚未透露涉案副機師的施襲動機。</summary></entry><entry><title>「工程師治國」：中國為何熱衷於「超級工程」？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c61kd3ze2mnno/trad#2</id><updated>2026-10-09T21:01:49Z</updated><published>2026-10-03T03:16:15Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c61kd3ze2mnno/trad--389d07ba0142.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c61kd3ze2mnno/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">大型建設工程正在重塑中國——從巨型大壩、龐大的太陽能發電場，到覆蓋全國的高鐵網絡。北京的「工程師思維」能否助其應對氣候變化？</summary></entry><entry><title>中國Z世代為何迷上玄學拜佛？ 什麼是「心靈經濟」？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cw80zedd4gd8o/trad#2</id><updated>2026-10-09T21:01:49Z</updated><published>2026-10-03T03:42:21Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cw80zedd4gd8o/trad--9adb52442aad.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cw80zedd4gd8o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">面對就業、收入與未來的焦慮，許多人希望藉此尋求運氣、心安以及掌控感。對某些人來說，這意味著去寺廟上香祈福或算命求籤；對另一些人來說，則是購買號稱能帶來好運的手鍊、符咒等各類產品。</summary></entry><entry><title>中國、台灣民眾如何看「習特會」？專家如何解讀峰會成果？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmq5x6557lqdo/trad#2</id><updated>2026-10-09T21:01:49Z</updated><published>2026-09-25T14:18:56Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmq5x6557lqdo/trad--18f15465e5e4.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmq5x6557lqdo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">中國國家主席習近平時隔11年再次訪美進行國是訪問，與美國總統特朗普舉行今年第二次會晤。今次「習特會」有哪些成果？中國及台灣民眾又如何看待？</summary></entry><entry><title>草原上的數據中心：中國AI雄心背後的算力前線</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/crje8gjn3nl5o/trad#2</id><updated>2026-10-09T21:01:49Z</updated><published>2026-09-23T13:24:03Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/crje8gjn3nl5o/trad--62ff8006dc2a.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/crje8gjn3nl5o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">在中國內蒙古遼闊的草原上，數十座數據中心正以驚人速度拔地而起。曾經的農田與草原，正在快速轉變為支撐中國AI雄心的「引擎」，以滿足狂飆的算力需求。</summary></entry><entry><title>「特習會」後兩架美國 F-16V 抵台 「雖遲但到」的時機與信號</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6pwg52xjp8jo/trad#3</id><updated>2026-10-09T21:01:49Z</updated><published>2026-10-05T00:14:01Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6pwg52xjp8jo/trad--32dd398252e7.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6pwg52xjp8jo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">本周五，台灣在2019年向美國訂購的2架F-16V戰機先行抵達台灣台東空軍志航基地，同批次共有66架同型號戰機，是1990 年代以來台灣首次戰機採購。</summary></entry><entry><title>特朗普排除美中合作開發人工智能</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm5ye14v6n8xo/trad#3</id><updated>2026-10-09T21:01:49Z</updated><published>2026-09-30T04:39:30Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm5ye14v6n8xo/trad--fb69b70800e6.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm5ye14v6n8xo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">美國總統繼續拒絕為人工智慧設立監管措施的呼籲，認為這將扼殺人工智慧的發展。</summary></entry><entry><title>特朗普習近平峰會：沒有說出口的議題可能更重要</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmzxzl450p2no/trad#3</id><updated>2026-10-09T21:01:49Z</updated><published>2026-09-29T03:48:29Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmzxzl450p2no/trad--249695977d55.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmzxzl450p2no/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">白宮峰會最耐人尋味之處，或許在於中美兩國領導人沒有說哪些事，以及我們至今仍不知道哪些事。</summary></entry><entry><title>為何特朗普在國宴上送習近平一座華麗的白頭海鵰雕像？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c3qjkx1wdyyxo/trad#3</id><updated>2026-10-09T21:01:49Z</updated><published>2026-09-25T04:56:06Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c3qjkx1wdyyxo/trad--c71e11bddace.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c3qjkx1wdyyxo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">從紅杉木長椅到DVD，饋贈禮物一直是外交藝術的重要一環。</summary></entry><entry><title>從年輕縣官到國家主席：習近平41年來的訪美影像</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c9zrz24j8pdvo/trad#3</id><updated>2026-10-09T21:01:49Z</updated><published>2026-09-22T14:36:55Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c9zrz24j8pdvo/trad--63b1eb81b86b.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c9zrz24j8pdvo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">習近平即將到訪美國會晤特朗普（川普），這將是他歷來第11次以中國官方身份訪美。從31歲縣委書記到中國國家主席，BBC中文透過歷年照片，回顧他的訪美行程如何隨身份和中美關係變化。</summary></entry><entry><title>台北選戰：蔣萬安的2028前哨戰，沈伯洋能否靠「洋流」突圍？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ck0j0wv57jw7o/trad#4</id><updated>2026-10-09T21:01:49Z</updated><published>2026-10-06T00:11:21Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ck0j0wv57jw7o/trad--60e83cbe470a.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ck0j0wv57jw7o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">原先不被看好的沈伯洋，自宣布參選後大力改變形象，近期聲勢高漲，給本享有執政優勢的蔣萬安帶來了挑戰。</summary></entry><entry><title>美國圖書館為何正迅速下架眾多圖書？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwzrd73z6k6mo/trad#4</id><updated>2026-10-09T21:01:49Z</updated><published>2026-10-06T06:31:55Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwzrd73z6k6mo/trad--3d503a550f93.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwzrd73z6k6mo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">美國公共圖書館已成為一場激烈意識形態衝突的戰場，這場衝突的焦點在於學生應該能夠獲得哪些書籍。</summary></entry><entry><title>喝多醉才算醉？康奈爾輪姦案指控揭「同意法」漏洞爭議</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cvwy7g2j0pk8o/trad#4</id><updated>2026-10-09T21:01:49Z</updated><published>2026-10-07T09:17:46Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cvwy7g2j0pk8o/trad--a8529ed2dad7.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cvwy7g2j0pk8o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">BBC 訪問多名專家，探討美國各州現行性侵法律，以及為何有人認為修法將有助保障涉嫌性侵案件的受害者。</summary></entry><entry><title>蔡康永現身造勢活動遭砲轟 盤點大陸商界「割席台獨」案例</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c98rzd82m7r1o/trad#4</id><updated>2026-10-09T21:01:49Z</updated><published>2026-10-05T12:26:26Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c98rzd82m7r1o/trad--6b03a763eca1.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c98rzd82m7r1o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">蔡康永現身民進黨沈伯洋造勢活動，事情登上微博熱搜；曾與其合作的大陸汽車企業發表聲明「割蓆」。</summary></entry><entry><title>加拿大為何要為（概率極小的）美國入侵做準備</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cr89zllz31wdo/trad#4</id><updated>2026-10-09T21:01:49Z</updated><published>2026-10-04T11:51:41Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cr89zllz31wdo/trad--2e67e2640a9d.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cr89zllz31wdo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">加拿大總理馬克‧卡尼表示，軍方正在製定應對方案，以防美國入侵加拿大這種不太可能發生的情況。</summary></entry><entry><title>「他們叫他爸爸」：震驚韓國的殘障院舍住戶性侵案</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cknv0d8qd7v7o/trad#5</id><updated>2026-10-09T21:01:49Z</updated><published>2026-10-05T10:15:06Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cknv0d8qd7v7o/trad--0a6a1ac930af.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cknv0d8qd7v7o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">BBC採訪了這所照護機構三名遭工作人員性侵院友中的其中一人。</summary></entry><entry><title>印度如何陷入對中國進口商品的危險依賴？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c98rzd1ye6n0o/trad#5</id><updated>2026-10-09T21:01:49Z</updated><published>2026-10-05T06:15:56Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c98rzd1ye6n0o/trad--0d6524b461fb.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c98rzd1ye6n0o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">印度的玩具店意外成為衡量中國與印度經濟關係的一項指標。</summary></entry><entry><title>西班牙與中國愈走愈近，歐盟多方為何不滿？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cx9808vgjy09o/trad#5</id><updated>2026-10-09T21:01:49Z</updated><published>2026-10-02T05:09:30Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cx9808vgjy09o/trad--3063e71a6b74.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cx9808vgjy09o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">全球局勢動盪之際，西班牙與中國意外走近，但這並非唯一不尋常的夥伴關係。</summary></entry><entry><title>「你有五年規劃，我有移民計劃」：香港年輕人為何焦慮？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cw804230yrjzo/trad#5</id><updated>2026-10-09T21:01:49Z</updated><published>2026-09-23T18:19:34Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cw804230yrjzo/trad--de8c1aec18c6.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cw804230yrjzo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">9月16日，香港特首李家超發表香港首個五年規劃文件及年度施政報告。但在網絡上，部分年輕人卻開始討論如何離開香港。BBC中文訪問三位香港青年，了解他們的看法。</summary></entry><entry><title>2026台灣地方選舉：「九合一」為何重要？選舉時程是什麼？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cp931k7xx4do/trad#5</id><updated>2026-10-09T21:01:49Z</updated><published>2026-09-16T04:47:26Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cp931k7xx4do/trad--d50ebbd623d5.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cp931k7xx4do/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">台灣的地方選舉又稱「九合一」選舉，每四年一次，多數落在總統任期中段的年底，故被視為總統的「期中考」。</summary></entry><entry><title>「地球不只有一個北極」——怎麼講？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c69wzrwr2z1eo/trad#6</id><updated>2026-10-09T21:01:49Z</updated><published>2026-10-08T02:16:46Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c69wzrwr2z1eo/trad--be6d5bef8044.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c69wzrwr2z1eo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">北極有不止一種定義，有些甚至不是固定不動的。</summary></entry><entry><title>寒背又疼痛？五個保護頸部的運動</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c3lylw2yx1pvo/trad#6</id><updated>2026-10-09T21:01:49Z</updated><published>2026-10-05T00:15:14Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c3lylw2yx1pvo/trad--3d466eb5f8f4.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c3lylw2yx1pvo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">現代生活為頸部帶來不少挑戰，但我們可以做很多事情，減低頸部問題出現的風險。</summary></entry><entry><title>為什麼有些人坐電動車更容易暈車？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cq62yr0ndd5zo/trad#6</id><updated>2026-10-09T21:01:49Z</updated><published>2026-10-03T04:19:55Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cq62yr0ndd5zo/trad--14e59404515c.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cq62yr0ndd5zo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">一名治療暈動症的醫生說：「（坐電動車暈車的個案）我聽過很多、很多、很多次。」</summary></entry><entry><title>人工智能末世論：為什麼有人相信AI是敵基督，誘騙人類崇拜撒旦</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c54g7dr9nlkpo/trad#6</id><updated>2026-10-09T21:01:49Z</updated><published>2026-09-29T00:07:32Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c54g7dr9nlkpo/trad--ffab2177ccfe.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c54g7dr9nlkpo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">許多知名基督徒在 TikTok、播客、出版物等各種平台上開始討論人工智能是否會成為世界毀滅的催化劑。</summary></entry><entry><title>在印尼一座熱帶島嶼上，備受珍視的「永恆積雪」即將永遠消失</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwly54drj5l1o/trad#6</id><updated>2026-10-09T21:01:49Z</updated><published>2026-09-29T00:07:17Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwly54drj5l1o/trad--98f7f9cf887c.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwly54drj5l1o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">氣候變化正改變著印尼巴布亞長年被積雪覆蓋的山峰，而這些山峰不但具有科學價值，還有其精神意義。</summary></entry></feed>
